Revision history for App-cpx

0.06  2026-10-10
    - Add a global -L/--lib option to choose the installation directory.
      The default is now a shared cache directory, ~/.cache/cpx (or
      $XDG_CACHE_HOME/cpx), instead of ./local, so that a binary installed
      from one working directory is found again - and not reinstalled - from
      any other one.  Options are only parsed before the binary name, so the
      binary's own options are passed through unchanged.
    - Add -h/--help.

0.05  2026-10-02
    - Fix the MetaCPAN API query: "filtered" was removed in Elasticsearch 6,
      use a "bool" query with a filter clause instead.
    - Request the download URL with "_source" source filtering instead of
      the deprecated Elasticsearch 2.x "fields" option.
    - Search the "file" type via the /file/_search route, as mapping types
      no longer exist in Elasticsearch 8.
    - Query the API with HTTP::Tiny and JSON::PP instead of
      Search::Elasticsearch: fastapi is a proxy that does not send the
      "x-elastic-product" response header, so the 8_0 client aborts every
      search with a ProductCheck error, while the 2_0 and 7_0 clients are
      no longer shipped.
    - Keep the $VERSION declared in bin/cpx in sync with the distribution.
